WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:48.980
Someone once said:

00:01:49.450 --> 00:01:53.190
There is a forest in which grow 
piping hot takoyaki mushrooms

00:01:53.190 --> 00:01:56.720
that are crispy on the outside, 
and creamy on the inside...

00:01:56.720 --> 00:02:00.830
The Forest of Takoyakishrooms!

00:02:02.030 --> 00:02:07.940
There are flaky biscuit geckos 
that smell of fragrant butter...

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:11.970
The Geckoscuits!

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:15.180
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:19.180
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:20.980 --> 00:02:22.950
This is Ice Mountain, in which sleeps

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:25.850
the Century Soup that only 
appears once every 100 years.

00:02:26.150 --> 00:02:27.890
The battle over the Century Soup

00:02:27.890 --> 00:02:32.160
between Toriko and a Vice-Chef of the 
Gourmet Corp., Tommyrod, continued!

00:02:33.190 --> 00:02:37.460
Just then, Komatsu, who was entrusted 
with capturing the soup by Toriko,

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:39.630
learned that there is a 
tiny bit of soup left.

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:41.500
Furthermore, there is a miniature GT Robot

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:43.670
which is secretly aiming 
for the Century Soup!

00:02:43.670 --> 00:02:45.770
The struggle over the soup heated up!

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:47.870
Toriko and Tommy were locked 
in a battle to the death!

00:02:47.870 --> 00:02:50.640
Then, Toriko was pushed all the 
way to the brink of defeat!

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:54.480
But Toriko started excreting phytoncide, 
which is hated by insects.

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:57.920
He managed to drive away the 
insects that Tommy had hatched.

00:02:58.350 --> 00:03:02.490
Finally, the final round of Toriko 
and Tommy's battle begins!

00:03:04.090 --> 00:03:09.460
Ultimate Desperation! Tommyrod's 
Full-Power Mode Explodes!

00:03:24.380 --> 00:03:31.620
My true battle starts now! I'm gonna 
show you my true hunting instinct!

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:34.950
But you could have had an easy death

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:37.390
if you just let yourself 
be killed by the bugs...

00:04:06.650 --> 00:04:07.850
Toriko...

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:45.790
He's fast.

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:47.960
And those sharp fangs...

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:50.230
Was he hiding them all this time

00:04:50.230 --> 00:04:53.560
because they get in the way 
of him hatching the insects?

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:56.870
This goes way beyond 
anything I've ever seen...

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:59.770
I can't even follow them...

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:16.580
Flying Fork!

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:27.130
He's faster than that stag beetle!

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:29.230
Unless I stop his movement somehow...

00:05:29.230 --> 00:05:31.230
Flying Knife!

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:11.000
Your precious fork breaks pretty easily.

00:06:14.570 --> 00:06:16.210
T-Toriko!

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:22.080
Same goes for those wings of yours!

00:06:36.260 --> 00:06:39.660
I never thought I'd get 
through this unscathed.

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:44.700
I've traded my left hand for your wing!

00:07:14.900 --> 00:07:18.440
Shivering? And that's 
some pretty intense heat!

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:25.140
What the...?

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:34.080
These are water vapor explosions!

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:39.960
He's probably putting the insect eggs 
under intense heat and pressure,

00:07:39.960 --> 00:07:41.660
and shooting them into my body

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:45.760
where the liquid in the eggs 
turns to steam and explodes!

00:07:53.900 --> 00:07:57.640
Shivering isn't just used for 
raising your body temperature...

00:07:57.640 --> 00:08:00.710
It can be used this way as well, Toriko!

00:08:06.350 --> 00:08:12.290
Now that I've stopped his movement, 
I've gotta get in close!

00:08:13.320 --> 00:08:17.290
A 10-Fold Spiked Punch didn't 
do much, which means...

00:08:17.290 --> 00:08:20.500
I gotta... I gotta up the number!

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:27.740
10-Fold... 11-Fold...

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:37.450
12-Fold...

00:08:45.990 --> 00:08:51.430
So what?! 12-Fold Spiked Punch!

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:08.510
You bastard... Punching with that arm...

00:09:16.650 --> 00:09:23.420
Here's more... 13-Fold Spiked Punch!

00:09:38.540 --> 00:09:39.640
Toriko!

00:10:16.940 --> 00:10:19.440
The Gourmet Show Window is crumbling!

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:22.810
What in the world is happening up there?

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:29.620
Zonge-sama, what should we do?

00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:34.520
What? "I've been Knocked and I can't move."

00:10:34.520 --> 00:10:37.660
"Don't worry about me and 
save yourselves", you say?!

00:10:37.660 --> 00:10:41.160
So brave and manly, as always!

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:45.640
Um... I think he probably 
said, "Carry me to safety."

00:10:47.170 --> 00:10:48.440
This is bad.

00:10:55.850 --> 00:10:57.680
T-Teppei-san?

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:02.720
What's that?

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:06.360
A Forestry Seed?

00:11:06.360 --> 00:11:09.360
Um... You can talk normally now.

00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:19.370
Protect Tree, grow and protect the ice!

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:44.890
Wow!

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:47.330
Komatsu-kun, I'd like you to come here.

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:50.800
The Protect Tree is nothing more 
than an emergency stop-gap measure.

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:53.430
I have to go above and protect 
the Gourmet Show Window.

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:54.600
Above?

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:56.740
Toriko-san!

00:12:46.190 --> 00:12:49.490
Move, right arm of mine!

00:12:53.260 --> 00:12:54.790
Move!

00:13:31.960 --> 00:13:35.070
Toriko!

00:13:35.770 --> 00:13:39.040
It's been so long since 
I've had a fight like this!

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:41.770
It's exhilarating!

00:13:42.570 --> 00:13:46.240
Nothing but pure instinct...

00:13:46.240 --> 00:13:50.210
Beyond animosity and anger... Just one thing!

00:13:50.210 --> 00:13:51.650
Sustenance!

00:13:51.650 --> 00:13:55.090
A 1-on-1 battle to eat!

00:13:55.320 --> 00:13:59.160
Natural selection, where 
the winner gets the food!

00:13:59.160 --> 00:14:03.830
A battle of nature, with not one regret!

00:14:03.830 --> 00:14:06.600
I think I know what Starjun and Grinpatch

00:14:06.600 --> 00:14:10.370
were so enthralled with when they fought you!

00:14:11.670 --> 00:14:14.800
A 13-Fold really was pushing it...

00:14:15.240 --> 00:14:18.240
I can't use my right hand any more.

00:14:18.740 --> 00:14:22.140
I... don't have any weapons left.

00:14:22.780 --> 00:14:25.680
Maybe it's finally time I accepted my fate...

00:14:35.620 --> 00:14:39.660
I've just gotten started! Come on, Tommy!

00:14:56.010 --> 00:15:00.620
You're... Maybe you're the first.

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:07.520
The first one to make me get serious...

00:15:29.180 --> 00:15:33.180
Toriko, I shall make you 
the first Gourmet Hunter

00:15:33.180 --> 00:15:37.680
I've ever deemed worthy of 
killing with my full power.

00:15:39.150 --> 00:15:42.990
He wasn't fighting with his 
full strength this whole time?!

00:15:49.330 --> 00:15:52.370
Crap... He's...

00:16:00.870 --> 00:16:02.470
I'm going to die...

00:16:07.510 --> 00:16:10.850
Komatsu-kun, should we be 
moving on our own like this?

00:16:10.850 --> 00:16:15.420
I have to find the Century 
Soup! I promised Toriko-san!

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:16.890
If only I can find it...

00:16:16.890 --> 00:16:19.660
If I can find the Aurora that 
indicates where the soup is...

00:16:25.700 --> 00:16:26.530
Watch out!

00:16:42.710 --> 00:16:43.780
Komatsu-kun!

00:16:43.780 --> 00:16:45.080
I'm fine!

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:48.550
I'll search for a way 
through, so wait a second!

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:49.920
Understood!

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:52.660
That was a close one...

00:17:24.620 --> 00:17:26.320
It's the Aurora!

00:17:26.320 --> 00:17:29.260
The Century Soup is here!

00:17:29.260 --> 00:17:30.290
Seriously?!

00:17:30.590 --> 00:17:32.500
Yes, for real!

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:37.330
Toriko-san, I did it!

00:17:37.330 --> 00:17:39.770
I found the Century Soup!

00:18:02.090 --> 00:18:03.090
Komatsu-kun?

00:18:03.690 --> 00:18:06.260
What's wrong? Komatsu-kun!

00:18:06.260 --> 00:18:08.160
Komatsu-kun!

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:10.470
Komatsu-kun!

00:18:33.150 --> 00:18:36.360
This is bad... I'm going to die...

00:18:44.160 --> 00:18:47.130
What is... that wound?

00:18:48.030 --> 00:18:51.370
How did I do that again?

00:19:28.440 --> 00:19:33.010
They say the legs are 3 or 4 times 
more powerful than the arms...

00:19:33.010 --> 00:19:35.410
That makes sense, I suppose.

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:39.450
Maybe I should name it my "Leg Knife"?

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:42.450
You bastard!

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:56.300
Leg Fork!

00:20:00.600 --> 00:20:05.280
At the bitter end, I managed 
some pretty amazing moves...

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:12.980
Although... that's all I got left in me...

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:19.390
To...ri...ko...

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:23.830
Toriko!

00:20:31.600 --> 00:20:33.770
What the hell is that?!

00:20:33.770 --> 00:20:34.940
A tree?!

00:20:45.210 --> 00:20:46.580
What?

00:20:47.420 --> 00:20:49.720
T-This is...

00:20:51.150 --> 00:20:55.720
Perhaps it'll be recognized as a Gourmet 
World Heritage Site eventually...

00:20:59.090 --> 00:21:04.970
So don't go breaking the Gourmet Show 
Window, a treasure of the world...

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:07.470
...Gourmet Corp.

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:14.610
I'm grumble-grumble hungry! 
My tummy's rumble rumblin'!

00:21:15.680 --> 00:21:18.880
Today we're out there: Ack 
SOS, I'm in trouble yes!

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:22.220
Gotta go! Gotta go! Can't 
leave this alone, right?

00:21:22.520 --> 00:21:25.690
Giving you support and cheer, 
the duties are endless!

00:21:25.690 --> 00:21:29.060
Burnin' up! Bustin' out! Trouble buster!

00:21:29.060 --> 00:21:32.130
Oh my god! A heaping helping of energy!

00:21:32.130 --> 00:21:35.900
When I'm hungry I can't get any power!

00:21:35.900 --> 00:21:39.470
Go, fight! At attention to you!

00:21:39.470 --> 00:21:42.600
Two-way communication!

00:21:42.600 --> 00:21:46.110
The encouragement I get 
from you is my nourishment!

00:21:46.370 --> 00:21:49.880
I want to eat lots of delicious things!

00:21:49.880 --> 00:21:53.250
Our future looks to be tasty!

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:55.080
Right? OK. Left? OK.

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:59.790
Be careful, courageously! Right on, let's go!

00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:03.360
Fight with bravery!

00:22:03.360 --> 00:22:07.060
Deli-deli delicious, and let's eat!

00:22:11.530 --> 00:22:13.430
Gourmet News!

00:22:14.570 --> 00:22:16.140
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:16.140 --> 00:22:19.310
The seed of the Protect 
Tree, the Forestry Seed...

00:22:19.310 --> 00:22:20.840
It's often confused with

00:22:20.840 --> 00:22:24.940
the "Nutritious Apple" Seed 
or "Nutripple" Seed for short.

00:22:24.940 --> 00:22:27.750
If you planted a seed you thought 
would grow an apple tree

00:22:27.750 --> 00:22:32.320
and a Protect Tree grew instead, 
how disappointing would that be!

00:22:32.320 --> 00:22:33.990
But there's no need to worry!

00:22:33.990 --> 00:22:38.120
If that happens, there's a simple way 
to recreate the taste of apple juice!

00:22:38.590 --> 00:22:41.290
If you mix barley tea and orange juice...

00:22:41.290 --> 00:22:45.500
You get a drink full of nutrients 
that tastes just like apple juice!

00:22:47.170 --> 00:22:48.630
Delicious!

00:22:48.630 --> 00:22:53.340
Huh? You get the nutrients of barley 
and oranges, but not apples, you say?

00:22:53.340 --> 00:22:55.840
Then... No apples means no trees...

00:22:55.840 --> 00:22:58.040
Instead of a Forestry it's more Deforestry?

00:22:58.040 --> 00:23:01.550
What? A cold front's moving through 
this week? And your point?

00:23:02.950 --> 00:23:05.020
Now then, on to the next story!

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:11.360
If Toriko wasn't in enough trouble, a huge monster shows up to make things worse!

00:23:11.700 --> 00:23:13.400
Wait, isn't this guy amazing?!

00:23:13.910 --> 00:23:16.390
Wondrous Power! Gourmet Reviver Teppei Joins the Battle!

00:23:16.790 --> 00:23:18.480
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
